---
---
<section>
    <h2>
        Obten tu descuento ingresando tu código promocional en el siguiente formulario
    </h2>
    <form class="mt-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-2">
        <input
            type="text"
            placeholder="Ingresa tu código promocional"
            class="flex-1 px-4 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-md focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500 focus:border-indigo-500"
        />
        <button
            type="submit"
            class="px-4 py-2 bg-indigo-600 text-white rounded-md hover:bg-indigo-700 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500 focus:ring-offset-2"
        >
            Aplicar Descuento
        </button>
</section>